    comparison logic is mine, not [38;5;153mjsonwebtoken[39m's. Right tradeoff for a zero-dependency POC; not something to ship.
  - [1mPassword reset grants account takeover.[0m The reset token printed to stdout is a full credential — anyone reading the
    logs can seize any account. Fine for a mock mailer, but it means logs are secrets here.

